{"id":"6c68e3aece7c6ffc","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md","title":"Arithmetic Progression","display":"df-arithmetic-progression — Arithmetic Progression","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-arithmetic-progression","aliases":["58-df-arithmetic-progression","Arithmetic Progression"],"display":"df-arithmetic-progression — Arithmetic Progression","depends_on":["[[58-df-integer]]","[[58-df-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-arithmetic-progression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-arithmetic-progression</span><span>Arithmetic Progression</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-progression — Arithmetic Progression"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"58-df-integer\">58-df-integer</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"58-df-sequence\">58-df-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb Z\\land d\\in\\mathbb Z\\land s\\in V\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb Z\\land d\\in\\mathbb Z\\land s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"58-df-sequence\">58-df-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithmeticProgression}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithmeticProgression}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}progression} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithmeticProgression}_S(s,a,d) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; a\\in\\mathbb Z\\land d\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(s,\\mathbb Z)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(s(n)=a+nd\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}progression} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithmeticProgression}_S(s,a,d) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; a\\in\\mathbb Z\\land d\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(s,\\mathbb Z)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(s(n)=a+nd\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>AP: sequence with constant difference; linear in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span></li>\n<li>van der Waerden: any finite coloring of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> contains monochromatic AP of any length</li>\n<li>Szemerédi: any set of positive upper density contains AP of length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span></li>\n<li>Roth's theorem: AP of length 3 in sets of positive density; very hard via Fourier</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tao and Vu, Additive Combinatorics</li>\n<li>Green and Tao, The Primes Contain Arbitrarily Long Arithmetic Progressions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-integer","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integer]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-sequence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb Z\\land d\\in\\mathbb Z\\land s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithmeticProgression}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}progression} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithmeticProgression}_S(s,a,d) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; a\\in\\mathbb Z\\land d\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(s,\\mathbb Z)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(s(n)=a+nd\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1305,"backlinks":[{"id":"a840395646191699","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$q\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$ 与 $a\\in\\mathbb Z$，并在断言中要求 $\\gcd(a,q)=1$（see [[../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md]]）"},{"id":"a477cc53c38e2d75","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-arithmetic-progression.md|58-df-arithmetic-progression]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["244943f88396309f","d8eb5064b65f8a92"]}